<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Beazer Homes downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Beazer Homes downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Beazer Homes USA Inc to hold from buy, based on the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 7/8 to 17-3/8.</p>
</text>
